      "id": "sol.ahsme-1976-p1.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The equation is \\[ 1-\\frac1{1-x}=\\frac1{1-x}. \\] Multiplying by \\(1-x\\ne0\\) gives \\(1-x-1=1,\\) so \\(x=-1.\\)\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is B.",
